ener\">#10</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQblFOUHlIMm1GZ211ZWF3cVBuRVh1bWdJQ2VuVWg0UUFHSlpzcXV2QVlkZmQ0ckJBOFhmUmtQRFU5UnhHVTVMdmZ0WXk1VC1yYXVSQ2pxU0hlU1VTY0ZrcHYxaFMyR0pRR3RCVm94ZV9YX21fVmZDRDFySXFweTNyYXE2ckp0Vnlwa0hR?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#11</a>].\n\n<b>5. M&amp;A 및 지분 투자를 통한 사업 확장</b>\n그린하버가 푸드나무 인수를 추진하며 인프라를 넘어 기업투자 분야로 영역을 넓히고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNRXF3S2FNNnBqSU92aFNNZEprNExMZ2ZtMFFDbGljZE9yTHBZdVZuMG5Sd1hNSC1YZFZiMzhEME96YXZxOE4zaTJvZDBiRDg4UUdaTU82Z2pJNUUzRTR2OXMwdnVxREZuN25VVVlCcmVZN1VYdmhVQVVxVXFZU0NUdzlrVDZRcGFsZ2Iw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#14</a>]. 휴맥스는 알티모빌리티 주식을 108억 원에 추가 취득해 지분율을 58.3%로 높였으며, SJG세종은 미국 자회사에 345억 원을 출자했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE94YWxTS205bjk4aDE5NUJWQzJfLU5iMXNRNk5HTVhNb0w2U0prUC1heXptbFdrUG1JbkhINFZYVzVrTkpjX29sRWd1NmZteTlfb2x5TUFfQlVhN1HSAWBBVV95cUxQZXg2UG9JNDA1eGJvS3ZDcGJ3a3BOWGY3ZUNtcndXSTIybUwtenNwZ3BaTE12NFJtQmpPcmFuN2Z0SHUzdkZFdjlhcGNkX25qd2o3TTc2bE9OakN0eVNRcDg?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20261022173700008\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#31</a>].", "brief_at": "2026-10-22 19:12", "premium": [{"t": "10-22 09:37", "title": "LGD, 칩플레이션에 모바일 OLED 수익성 '고심'", "link": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE0tMkFuV0pYd0Jhb3dkUVE3c0J2b24ydVItbTM2RDJ6MGdTNk90aHNYMFBQcGR1R1J6aU4wbnJfNE1WanpwOEZrSnFTdDJTLTQ?oc=5", "src": "딜사이트(dealsite) · 기업금융"}, {"t": "10-22 09:18", "title": "IPARK현대산업개발, 자체사업·외주주택 '두마리 토끼' 잡아", "link": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE9vY3g0ODdlQjA3WFlRZk5GMXUtTGlqdjczMGpTb2ZUb3A3d1FHbERYcTZmeGt6SWJ4REJLU194YjZBY1JBbFctV2ZGWHdrNGM?oc=5", "src": "딜사이트(dealsite) · 기업금융"}, {"t": "10-22 09:16", "title": "삼성E&A, 첨단산업·뉴에너지 성장에 화공 수익성 더했다", "link": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE42VjIxRTNKalA4Ull5dmRENm1Ncy1DOWs1N2VaZlkzWEZ0akNsSGZFOGJiZ1c3YVo5ZVFz